OL,5,G0105 The Highland Vet
OL,6,     FOn-call vet David is busy through
OL,7,     Fthe night shift, as the calving
OL,8,     Fseason gets underway and a
OL,9,     FLabrador returns with a lump that
OL,10,     Fhas grown to the size of a
OL,11,     Fgrapefruit.
OL,12,G0205 The Highland Vet
OL,13,     FVet William is on duty in the
OL,14,     Flarge animal wing of the practice
OL,15,     Fwhen, as the day draws to a close,
OL,16,     Flocal crofter Jim arrives with a
OL,17,     Flamb that has a suspected broken
OL,18,     Fleg.
